Package: firmware-xiaomi-vermeer
Version: 20260905
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: yalei16
Conflicts: linux-firmware
Replaces: linux-firmware
Description: Firmware blobs & configs for Xiaomi Redmi K70 / POCO F6 Pro (vermeer)
  WCN7850 (ath12k) WiFi/BT firmware, Adreno A740 zap/sqe, IAS/VIDEO/VPU/CAMERA ICP
  blobs, aw882xx ACF and Goodix touch firmware, extracted from the device vendor
  partition. Binary payload is downloaded at build time from
  Xlie-Electronic-Customs/linux-firmware-xiaomi-vermeer; it is not redistributed
  by this repository.
